WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.185 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:43.265 --> 01:44.385
Deadly trials?

5
01:44.985 --> 01:46.465
What if she can't get through it?

6
01:46.545 --> 01:48.585
Bloodshed and death hang over her.

7
01:49.185 --> 01:50.745
If she cannot get through it,

8
01:50.825 --> 01:53.545
then I'm afraid her death is fast approaching.

9
01:53.625 --> 01:56.585
She will not live past her twenties.

10
01:57.625 --> 01:58.585
How dare you!

11
01:58.665 --> 02:00.425
How dare you curse my daughter?

12
02:00.505 --> 02:01.785
Yi Jiang,

13
02:01.865 --> 02:02.825
how dare you speak such nonsense?

14
02:02.905 --> 02:04.505
Apologize to Her Ladyship at once.

15
02:06.665 --> 02:07.585
I spoke frankly.

16
02:08.265 --> 02:09.225
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

17
02:10.265 --> 02:11.265
It's nothing.

18
02:12.585 --> 02:15.905
Nuwa and Fuxi wanted to take me to paradise.

19
02:15.985 --> 02:17.345
I told them I wouldn't go.

20
02:17.425 --> 02:19.505
I have another 80 years to live.

21
02:20.785 --> 02:24.345
Yi Jiang, watch closely and see for yourself.

22
02:24.905 --> 02:26.705
I won't settle for even one day less.

23
02:26.785 --> 02:29.625
I spoke out of turn. Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

24
02:30.905 --> 02:34.505
Fortune-telling is just for fun.

25
02:34.585 --> 02:36.985
You needn't take it to heart.

26
02:38.505 --> 02:40.985
Hualou, is your painting finished?

27
02:46.665 --> 02:48.265
Lady Zheng, it's finished.

28
02:53.545 --> 02:56.385
No wonder you're famed throughout the capital for your talent.

29
02:56.465 --> 02:59.145
It really captures the spirit,

30
02:59.225 --> 03:00.345
remarkably so.

31
03:00.945 --> 03:02.345
Attendants, reward her.

32
03:03.585 --> 03:04.625
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

33
03:04.705 --> 03:05.985
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

34
03:06.065 --> 03:09.145
I invited Noble Lady Wu'an here today to discuss another important matter.

35
03:11.225 --> 03:14.585
The Crown Prince is nearly 30 and still childless.

36
03:15.105 --> 03:19.505
I hear your foster sister is gentle and virtuous.

37
03:19.585 --> 03:21.985
I'd like her to become the Crown Prince's secondary consort,

38
03:22.065 --> 03:25.745
so she may bear him children and continue his line.

39
03:26.265 --> 03:30.425
Your Ladyship, what do you think?

40
03:31.985 --> 03:35.025
My sister cannot speak. I'm afraid she cannot serve His Highness.

41
03:35.705 --> 03:37.505
Hongxian wasn't born mute.

42
03:38.745 --> 03:40.425
After some treatment from the imperial physicians,

43
03:40.505 --> 03:41.545
she'll recover.

44
03:42.825 --> 03:43.745
Hongxian,

45
03:44.585 --> 03:45.865
your sister can't bear to part with you.

46
03:47.585 --> 03:49.065
But you mustn't be ungrateful.

47
03:49.985 --> 03:50.985
Come now.

48
03:51.065 --> 03:52.665
Thank Lady Zheng for this honor.

49
03:56.585 --> 03:57.425
Lady Zheng,

50
03:59.065 --> 04:00.345
Hongxian is already betrothed.

51
04:03.345 --> 04:05.465
Who would dare offend the heir to the throne?

52
04:05.545 --> 04:06.945
Have him call off the engagement.

53
04:08.025 --> 04:08.945
Good girl,

54
04:10.385 --> 04:11.665
it's time to give thanks.

55
04:12.745 --> 04:13.625
Go on.

56
04:21.265 --> 04:22.305
Stop!

57
04:24.025 --> 04:25.505
I won't allow it!

58
04:25.585 --> 04:27.185
Noble Lady Wu'an,

59
04:27.705 --> 04:30.345
an imperial offer of marriage cannot be refused.

60
04:30.425 --> 04:31.985
Do you plan to defy imperial authority

61
04:32.065 --> 04:34.025
for a girl of common birth?

62
04:35.185 --> 04:36.545
Lady Zheng,

63
04:36.625 --> 04:38.305
Rao and Hongxian share a deep bond.

64
04:39.305 --> 04:40.705
Rao has settled Hongxian's marriage.

65
04:40.785 --> 04:42.785
Why put her in such a difficult position

66
04:42.865 --> 04:44.065
by insisting on taking her as a consort?

67
04:44.665 --> 04:46.025
Because the Crown Prince has taken a fancy to her

68
04:46.625 --> 04:47.825
and insists on taking her as a consort.

69
04:49.305 --> 04:50.425
Hualou,

70
04:51.145 --> 04:52.625
if the Crown Prince wanted you as his consort,

71
04:52.705 --> 04:54.345
how would you react?

72
04:55.705 --> 04:56.705
I would simply obey.

73
04:57.585 --> 04:58.705
Did you hear that?

74
04:58.785 --> 05:00.665
When a man of higher rank wants a lowborn woman,

75
05:00.745 --> 05:02.945
she must simply obey.

76
05:03.025 --> 05:04.985
Even if you take this to His Majesty,

77
05:05.065 --> 05:08.665
His Majesty will never permit anyone to defy their betters

78
05:08.745 --> 05:09.985
and disobey the imperial family.

79
05:10.065 --> 05:11.385
That is the law.

80
05:11.465 --> 05:13.105
That is propriety.

81
05:33.785 --> 05:35.305
I wouldn't dare offend you.

82
05:37.625 --> 05:38.865
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

83
05:44.585 --> 05:46.025
Noble Lady Wu'an,

84
05:47.425 --> 05:49.225
at least you know how to behave.

85
05:54.665 --> 05:56.705
I have something to tell Your Ladyship.

86
05:56.785 --> 05:59.225
May I come closer to speak?

87
06:09.585 --> 06:12.665
A mother rises in status through her son.

88
06:13.825 --> 06:17.785
The mother of the Crown Prince is traditionally made Empress.

89
06:18.745 --> 06:21.065
Yet you still haven't been given that title.

90
06:22.425 --> 06:25.185
So who are you to act like you're already Empress?

91
06:26.065 --> 06:26.905
How dare you!

92
06:31.545 --> 06:32.265
Rao!

93
06:34.625 --> 06:35.585
Rao!

94
06:36.265 --> 06:37.185
You…

95
06:39.025 --> 06:42.345
What have I done to offend Your Ladyship that you had to strike me like that?

96
06:43.585 --> 06:44.625
I… I didn't even…

97
06:44.705 --> 06:47.185
You vile woman! How dare you hurt my daughter?

98
06:49.425 --> 06:50.425
How dare you hit me?

99
06:53.065 --> 06:54.105
Mother!

100
06:55.625 --> 06:56.705
Stop!

101
06:56.785 --> 06:58.225
-Stop! -Mother.

102
07:00.745 --> 07:02.385
What is all this racket?

103
07:09.185 --> 07:10.185
Greetings, Your Majesty.

104
07:16.785 --> 07:18.225
Your Majesty,

105
07:18.305 --> 07:20.385
Lady Zheng attacked my daughter without cause.

106
07:20.465 --> 07:23.545
I beg Your Majesty for justice.

107
07:23.625 --> 07:25.345
Did this really happen?

108
07:26.865 --> 07:28.145
Come on. Get up.

109
07:28.905 --> 07:30.585
All of you, rise.

110
07:35.145 --> 07:36.185
Your Majesty,

111
07:36.705 --> 07:38.905
the Crown Prince has taken a liking to Noble Lady Wu'an's foster sister

112
07:38.985 --> 07:40.105
and wishes to take her as a secondary consort.

113
07:40.785 --> 07:42.745
Lady Zheng kindly offered to arrange the match, but she…

114
07:42.825 --> 07:44.385
Your Majesty,

115
07:44.465 --> 07:48.425
Wu'an spoke insolently and humiliated me.

116
07:48.505 --> 07:51.785
All I did was tell Lady Zheng that Hongxian was already betrothed,

117
07:52.585 --> 07:54.025
and she slapped me.

118
07:55.225 --> 07:56.305
I've been wronged.

119
07:56.825 --> 07:58.265
I beg Your Majesty to judge fairly.

120
07:58.345 --> 08:00.785
-You clearly said… -Said what?

121
08:05.985 --> 08:09.385
Lady Wang heard our conversation.

122
08:10.945 --> 08:12.465
Lady Wang, please tell us what you heard.

123
08:16.705 --> 08:17.785
Your Majesty,

124
08:19.025 --> 08:20.185
I was present.

125
08:20.785 --> 08:22.385
I certainly

126
08:24.665 --> 08:26.225
didn't hear anything offensive.

127
08:27.105 --> 08:28.825
For reasons I don't know,

128
08:28.905 --> 08:30.225
Lady Zheng lost her temper

129
08:30.305 --> 08:32.264
and struck Noble Lady Wu'an on the right cheek.

130
08:32.345 --> 08:35.305
Xie Hualou, you were there too.

131
08:35.385 --> 08:36.825
Please tell us the truth.

132
08:38.144 --> 08:39.385
I…

133
08:42.985 --> 08:45.105
I couldn't hear clearly.

134
08:47.425 --> 08:50.785
What exactly have I done wrong? Please do let me know, Lady Zheng.

135
08:51.625 --> 08:52.585
You…

136
08:57.145 --> 08:58.265
Your Majesty,

137
08:58.865 --> 09:01.345
all I said was that a mother's status rises with her son's.

138
09:01.945 --> 09:03.945
-The Crown Prince… -A mother's status rises with her son's.

139
09:04.545 --> 09:07.425
Once Hongxian enters the Crown Prince's household and bears a child,

140
09:08.265 --> 09:10.505
His Majesty will reward her handsomely.

141
09:10.585 --> 09:12.785
Noble Lady Wu'an will share in that honor too.

142
09:12.865 --> 09:15.145
What's wrong with that?

143
09:17.585 --> 09:20.265
The Crown Prince has taken a fancy to Wu'an's foster sister?

144
09:20.345 --> 09:21.185
Where is she?

145
09:29.425 --> 09:30.425
Raise your head.

146
09:41.785 --> 09:43.465
Your Majesty, my sister is already…

147
09:45.625 --> 09:46.465
Father, forgive me.

148
09:47.065 --> 09:48.145
This happened because of me.

149
09:48.745 --> 09:49.985
It's entirely my fault.

150
09:50.585 --> 09:53.065
I often visit my sister, and I've long had my eye on Hongxian.

151
09:54.465 --> 09:56.665
But since I haven't taken a principal wife,

152
09:57.185 --> 10:00.345
my sister feared you'd think me young and reckless.

153
10:00.425 --> 10:03.345
So she did all she could to conceal it and dared not comply.

154
10:05.985 --> 10:08.785
Oh, you. That really was unacceptable.

155
10:09.385 --> 10:11.265
How could you let your sister take the blame?

156
10:12.905 --> 10:13.865
Your Majesty,

157
10:14.465 --> 10:15.825
well…

158
10:17.465 --> 10:18.665
You little rascal.

159
10:19.265 --> 10:21.585
You're reckless and out of control.

160
10:22.345 --> 10:26.225
From now on, discipline yourself and conduct yourself with dignity.

161
10:26.305 --> 10:28.545
If you get out of line again,

162
10:28.625 --> 10:30.345
I won't let you off lightly.

163
10:31.865 --> 10:32.985
Yes.

164
10:33.625 --> 10:35.625
As for this girl…

165
10:37.865 --> 10:39.145
Your Majesty…

166
10:40.465 --> 10:43.625
The Crown Prince should cherish his brothers

167
10:43.705 --> 10:44.665
and treat them with courtesy.

168
10:45.385 --> 10:47.265
only then can he be a model for the realm.

169
10:48.785 --> 10:50.025
It's only one woman.

170
10:50.105 --> 10:52.985
Find him another suitable girl.

171
10:54.385 --> 10:55.465
And you.

172
10:56.305 --> 10:59.305
If your daughter has been wronged, come to me for a fair judgment.

173
10:59.385 --> 11:01.545
You shouldn't have acted rashly

174
11:02.145 --> 11:04.025
and disgraced the imperial family.

175
11:05.065 --> 11:06.225
Your punishment…

176
11:09.585 --> 11:11.585
Both of you were at fault.

177
11:11.665 --> 11:13.105
You'll each lose a year's allowance

178
11:13.705 --> 11:15.985
and remain in your palace for a month to reflect.

179
11:17.625 --> 11:18.825
Your Majesty is wise.

180
11:38.025 --> 11:40.585
Was everything you said at the banquet true?

181
11:41.265 --> 11:44.105
Noble Lady Wu'an's features foretell a noble destiny.

182
11:44.625 --> 11:45.705
No, more than that.

183
11:46.345 --> 11:49.305
Her authority will grow, and the people will rally to her.

184
11:49.385 --> 11:51.585
Wherever she directs her banner, none will dare disobey.

185
11:51.665 --> 11:53.945
Even the reigning Empress Dowager

186
11:54.025 --> 11:55.745
doesn't have features like hers.

187
11:56.865 --> 11:59.345
But her ear rims turn outward,

188
11:59.865 --> 12:01.305
and she has a fiery temper.

189
12:01.825 --> 12:04.425
A flame that burns too fiercely consumes its wick.

190
12:04.945 --> 12:07.025
How can a candle like that last long in the wind?

191
12:07.625 --> 12:11.745
The fiercer the flame, the sooner it burns out.

192
12:12.905 --> 12:14.625
She may enjoy great glory for a time,

193
12:14.705 --> 12:16.825
but will never see past her blossoming years.

194
12:17.465 --> 12:18.785
Exactly.

195
12:19.865 --> 12:21.745
The Crown Prince wanted a common girl.

196
12:21.825 --> 12:23.865
She should have let him have her. But she refused.

197
12:24.905 --> 12:26.345
She's rebellious by nature.

198
12:27.985 --> 12:30.465
Now that you've seen her for yourself, I can rest easy.

199
12:31.065 --> 12:32.425
Marked for an early death

200
12:33.385 --> 12:34.905
with the makings of a tyrant.

201
12:36.025 --> 12:38.265
And she's a woman, no less.

202
12:38.945 --> 12:40.145
What a pity.

203
12:40.985 --> 12:42.345
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

204
12:42.425 --> 12:43.665
Hualou, please don't be angry.

205
12:43.745 --> 12:45.985
I have a few things to say. I'll leave once I've said them.

206
12:46.785 --> 12:48.665
Grand Tutor Xie enjoys an honorable reputation,

207
12:48.745 --> 12:50.505
but your father holds only the rank of viscount.

208
12:51.025 --> 12:53.305
I'll ask Father to make him a marquis,

209
12:54.025 --> 12:56.105
give 3000 jin of gold as a betrothal gift,

210
12:56.185 --> 12:58.265
and expand the Xie family's fief by a hundred li.

211
12:59.065 --> 13:00.625
You truly want to marry me?

212
13:01.345 --> 13:02.745
Then why did you ask for Hongxian?

213
13:04.745 --> 13:06.105
Only to save her.

214
13:07.265 --> 13:08.705
You come from a distinguished family,

215
13:08.785 --> 13:11.025
act with sound judgment, and carry yourself with grace.

216
13:11.105 --> 13:13.945
Surely you can see beyond petty matters of love, right?

217
13:16.625 --> 13:18.785
You can take as many concubines as you like.

218
13:19.505 --> 13:20.345
It's just…

219
13:20.425 --> 13:22.945
what if Hongxian becomes another Yi Jiang,

220
13:23.745 --> 13:24.985
and you lose your head over her one day…

221
13:29.265 --> 13:30.825
I'm not Prince Fu.

222
13:31.505 --> 13:33.905
By custom, an emperor's son who takes a principal wife

223
13:33.985 --> 13:34.825
can be granted a princely title.

224
13:35.425 --> 13:36.785
You'll have the status of a prince's wife,

225
13:36.865 --> 13:38.625
with all the honor and dignity that entails.

226
13:39.225 --> 13:41.345
I'll cherish you and treat you well for life.

227
13:41.425 --> 13:42.505
No other woman will take precedence over you.

228
13:43.105 --> 13:44.225
There.

229
13:44.305 --> 13:46.185
I've said what I came to say.

230
13:46.265 --> 13:47.345
Please, think this through.

231
13:48.865 --> 13:50.025
Stop the carriage!

232
13:51.865 --> 13:52.985
Wait.

233
13:56.905 --> 14:00.505
Alert your sister to be careful with the Crown Princess.

234
14:01.025 --> 14:03.025
She's been in contact with some of the displaced from Ancheng.

235
14:05.225 --> 14:06.105
All right.

236
14:06.625 --> 14:08.065
Once I've spoken to Father,

237
14:08.145 --> 14:09.305
I'll visit your family at once to ask for your hand.

238
14:21.505 --> 14:24.265
SONGYUE HALL

239
14:24.345 --> 14:26.345
-My Lord. -Has Her Ladyship returned?

240
14:26.865 --> 14:29.265
She has, but…

241
14:29.345 --> 14:30.505
What's wrong?

242
14:49.225 --> 14:50.425
Finished with military business?

243
14:52.825 --> 14:54.945
I came back early after inspecting the troops.

244
14:57.545 --> 14:58.985
What happened at the palace?

245
15:00.625 --> 15:01.705
Nothing much.

246
15:02.305 --> 15:05.425
Prince Fu's favorite concubine, Yi Jiang, who is skilled at reading faces,

247
15:05.945 --> 15:06.945
said I would face trials.

248
15:07.785 --> 15:09.625
All that mystical nonsense and fearmongering

249
15:09.705 --> 15:10.905
was quite upsetting.

250
15:13.665 --> 15:14.825
Is that what she said?

251
15:15.665 --> 15:16.505
What else did she say?

252
15:17.665 --> 15:19.105
Is Yi Jiang really that accurate?

253
15:19.705 --> 15:21.105
Prince Fu dotes on her.

254
15:21.625 --> 15:24.625
His travel dates, clothes, carriages, and routes

255
15:24.705 --> 15:25.905
all depend on her divinations.

256
15:28.225 --> 15:29.905
He treats her like a fortune-teller.

257
15:30.585 --> 15:32.025
Prince Fu really is foolish.

258
15:32.105 --> 15:33.585
No wonder Xie Hualou wouldn't marry him.

259
15:33.665 --> 15:35.305
He isn't foolish.

260
15:35.985 --> 15:37.465
Yi Jiang must have some extraordinary ability.

261
15:40.825 --> 15:41.665
Starting tomorrow,

262
15:42.305 --> 15:43.745
take Zhao Song and Zhao Bai whenever you go out.

263
15:44.745 --> 15:45.785
You believe her too?

264
15:45.865 --> 15:47.585
Your safety is at stake.

265
15:48.105 --> 15:50.385
I'd rather take the warning seriously. It's settled.

266
15:54.305 --> 15:56.065
My Lord, you have a visitor.

267
15:57.585 --> 15:58.425
Who's here?

268
15:59.825 --> 16:00.945
It's probably military business.

269
16:01.825 --> 16:02.665
I'll be right back.

270
16:12.985 --> 16:14.145
Aman.

271
16:21.465 --> 16:22.625
Pack some valuables and money.

272
16:23.145 --> 16:23.985
At the Zi hour tonight…

273
16:43.705 --> 16:45.545
I've arranged a place for you to hide.

274
16:45.625 --> 16:46.945
Xiao will be waiting there.

275
16:47.025 --> 16:48.625
You'll leave the city at the Yin hour.

276
16:50.785 --> 16:51.705
Don't ask questions.

277
16:52.305 --> 16:53.385
Get in the carriage.

278
16:55.225 --> 16:56.385
Hurry.

279
17:01.665 --> 17:02.465
Don't move.

280
17:02.545 --> 17:03.865
Stop!

281
17:06.345 --> 17:07.505
Zhao Bai, put away your sword.

282
17:08.745 --> 17:10.105
Hongxian, get in.

283
17:11.025 --> 17:12.345
His Majesty has approved.

284
17:12.424 --> 17:14.305
Hongxian must marry the Fourth Prince.

285
17:15.545 --> 17:16.625
Otherwise, if the truth comes out later,

286
17:17.224 --> 17:19.505
Lady Li and Liu Shuo will both be implicated.

287
17:20.985 --> 17:22.424
Don't worry about that. Get in.

288
17:26.865 --> 17:28.105
Why won't you listen?

289
17:28.184 --> 17:29.465
I'm telling you to leave!

290
17:29.545 --> 17:30.625
Wei Rao!

291
17:36.625 --> 17:37.665
Fine.

292
17:38.825 --> 17:40.265
Have it your way.

293
17:41.265 --> 17:42.545
I'm done looking after you.

294
18:14.985 --> 18:18.025
We're not related by blood, yet you've caused me so much trouble.

295
18:18.105 --> 18:19.705
I should never have meddled.

296
18:20.465 --> 18:21.985
I should have sent you away long ago.

297
18:23.105 --> 18:25.505
From now on, I won't concern myself whether you live or die,

298
18:37.545 --> 18:40.585
Liu Shuo will take a wife from a suitable noble family.

299
18:41.265 --> 18:43.865
Even if he favors you for my sake,

300
18:43.945 --> 18:46.105
you'll still be a lowly concubine.

301
18:46.785 --> 18:48.385
Think of Madam Ge in the tenement.

302
18:49.345 --> 18:50.945
Simply because of her beautiful eyes,

303
18:51.545 --> 18:54.105
the principal wife grew jealous and blinded her.

304
18:55.705 --> 18:58.745
You can't even cry out in pain. How can I possibly not worry?

305
19:02.425 --> 19:05.825
You worked yourself to the bone to feed our family.

306
19:05.905 --> 19:09.905
I always thought that once I grew up,

307
19:10.505 --> 19:12.185
I'd be willing to become a concubine,

308
19:12.945 --> 19:14.705
even a slave or a prostitute,

309
19:14.785 --> 19:18.305
so you wouldn't have to work so hard again.

310
19:19.145 --> 19:20.225
Hongxian…

311
19:20.825 --> 19:22.505
As a prince's concubine,

312
19:24.265 --> 19:25.265
I won't go hungry again.

313
19:26.345 --> 19:27.265
That's a good thing.

314
19:28.385 --> 19:29.545
I don't want to leave.

315
19:30.145 --> 19:33.225
Those who trampled on me must pay for what they did.

316
19:33.305 --> 19:34.425
I have to see it.

317
19:34.505 --> 19:36.105
Until then, even in death,

318
19:36.785 --> 19:38.225
I won't rest in peace.

319
19:41.785 --> 19:43.065
Are you sure?

320
19:47.225 --> 19:48.225
Very well.

321
19:51.145 --> 19:55.345
Do you know why I provoked Lady Zheng today?

322
19:57.745 --> 20:00.625
First, to get us out of there quickly.

323
20:01.145 --> 20:02.105
Second,

324
20:04.305 --> 20:05.465
who do you think

325
20:06.385 --> 20:08.705
most longs for the Emperor's death?

326
20:09.785 --> 20:12.425
The Crown Prince and his mother.

327
20:14.425 --> 20:15.705
The more impatient they are,

328
20:16.585 --> 20:18.305
the more likely they are to make mistakes.

329
20:19.025 --> 20:20.705
An ant can hardly topple a great tree,

330
20:22.225 --> 20:23.705
but termites can hollow it out.

331
20:25.305 --> 20:26.265
Don't worry.

332
20:27.305 --> 20:29.265
I won't forget what they did to you.

333
20:29.985 --> 20:32.905
I won't forget those girls he abused.

334
20:46.305 --> 20:47.825
Why did avoid your sister?

335
20:48.905 --> 20:50.945
My sister and I have only recently become family.

336
20:51.025 --> 20:52.625
She's far closer to Hongxian than to me.

337
20:53.145 --> 20:54.945
I only asked to marry Hongxian to save her,

338
20:55.025 --> 20:57.705
but she may think I have an ulterior motive.

339
20:58.505 --> 20:59.945
You really have feelings for Hongxian?

340
21:01.465 --> 21:04.145
In this palace, there's every kind of beauty you can imagine.

341
21:04.945 --> 21:06.865
My sister has always kept me at a distance.

342
21:07.465 --> 21:08.825
Hongxian is her foster sister.

343
21:09.465 --> 21:12.705
I approached Hongxian to learn more about my sister's past.

344
21:13.305 --> 21:14.705
I also wanted to understand

345
21:14.785 --> 21:17.185
why my sister cared for her so much, so protective of her.

346
21:18.025 --> 21:20.545
By chance, it ended in a marriage arrangement.

347
21:22.625 --> 21:24.705
Lord Lu, I'll be direct.

348
21:24.785 --> 21:26.665
I came to say just two things.

349
21:27.385 --> 21:30.185
First, there's something uncanny about Yi Jiang.

350
21:30.265 --> 21:31.225
Her readings are never wrong.

351
21:31.305 --> 21:33.305
You must warn my sister to be careful.

352
21:33.385 --> 21:36.745
-I will. -Second, the Crown Prince…

353
21:36.825 --> 21:38.825
He's about to make a move. We should be on our guard.

354
21:53.985 --> 21:54.905
Forgive me, Your Ladyship.

355
21:55.625 --> 21:56.465
Get out!

356
21:57.545 --> 21:58.945
All of you, get out!

357
21:59.025 --> 22:02.905
BLOSSOMS NESTLED IN DEW

358
22:11.225 --> 22:14.145
Mother, let me do it.

359
22:27.425 --> 22:30.705
Wei Rao is arrogant, but she wasn't wrong.

360
22:31.465 --> 22:32.865
His Majesty's affection has faded.

361
22:32.945 --> 22:34.345
You've long been out of favor.

362
22:34.425 --> 22:36.265
Becoming Empress is now an impossible dream.

363
22:36.785 --> 22:38.985
You'd do better to support the Crown Prince.

364
22:40.145 --> 22:41.025
How dare you!

365
22:41.625 --> 22:43.225
Who are you to say such things?

366
22:46.425 --> 22:47.505
In this world,

367
22:48.545 --> 22:51.385
the Crown Prince is the only one you can rely on.

368
22:58.105 --> 23:01.185
Is His Majesty still taking medicine?

369
23:02.225 --> 23:03.345
Why do you ask?

370
23:04.025 --> 23:08.625
Wu'an's insolence has made you ill with distress.

371
23:08.705 --> 23:10.105
To silence the gossip,

372
23:10.705 --> 23:13.945
His Majesty will surely visit you often.

373
23:18.625 --> 23:20.745
When the late Emperor died,

374
23:21.545 --> 23:23.265
the lives of his consorts

375
23:23.865 --> 23:25.665
were entirely at the Empress Dowager's mercy.

376
23:26.345 --> 23:28.185
Lady Li is in favor only because of her beauty.

377
23:28.265 --> 23:29.625
How long can her good fortune last?

378
23:31.585 --> 23:34.265
Your Ladyship, just keep your composure

379
23:35.145 --> 23:36.905
and be patient.

380
23:46.825 --> 23:48.105
Say no more.

381
23:50.345 --> 23:51.825
Let me think it over.

382
23:52.625 --> 23:55.225
Are you sure you can persuade Mother?

383
23:56.145 --> 23:58.505
Who could resist the chance

384
23:58.585 --> 24:01.025
to wield power in Weiyang Palace

385
24:01.105 --> 24:03.345
and hold all of Chang'an in their grasp?

386
24:04.305 --> 24:05.465
HENGCHENG GATE

387
24:05.545 --> 24:06.625
Lord Han,

388
24:07.305 --> 24:08.945
what did the Empress Dowager say?

389
24:09.785 --> 24:12.425
She deeply resents all three of the Zhou family.

390
24:12.505 --> 24:13.625
The plan will certainly work.

391
24:14.225 --> 24:15.225
However…

392
24:16.065 --> 24:17.185
Once we succeed,

393
24:17.265 --> 24:20.025
the Crown Prince will strip the Lu family of military power,

394
24:20.105 --> 24:22.145
promote you to General-in-Chief,

395
24:22.225 --> 24:24.785
and give your family back its lands and title.

396
24:25.425 --> 24:26.585
Good.

397
24:28.105 --> 24:30.705
The Han family will serve the Crown Prince

398
24:30.785 --> 24:33.505
and gladly give our lives for him.

399
24:38.705 --> 24:40.505
How do you plan to deal with Wei Rao?

400
24:41.105 --> 24:44.745
Noble Lady Wu'an saves those in peril and is widely revered.

401
24:45.265 --> 24:47.065
Zhuyu Estate has become a haven.

402
24:49.785 --> 24:51.305
But branches can grow too heavy for a tree,

403
24:51.385 --> 24:52.345
and an estate too large to control.

404
24:52.945 --> 24:54.385
Her greatest strength

405
24:54.465 --> 24:58.865
will also be her fatal weakness.

406
25:04.545 --> 25:05.665
ZHAO

407
25:05.745 --> 25:10.305
Nice!

408
25:10.385 --> 25:11.545
Go, General Qi!

409
25:11.625 --> 25:12.665
-Nice blow! -Go, General Qi!

410
25:12.745 --> 25:13.745
Go, General Qi!

411
25:13.825 --> 25:16.265
-Come on. -Go, General Qi!

412
25:16.345 --> 25:19.985
Yes!

413
25:20.065 --> 25:22.545
-Go, General Qi! -Go, General Qi!

414
25:22.625 --> 25:23.905
-General Qi! -Well done!

415
25:23.985 --> 25:25.105
Go, General Qi!

416
25:25.705 --> 25:26.665
Keep it up!

417
25:26.745 --> 25:28.905
Nice!

418
25:28.985 --> 25:29.985
General Qi!

419
25:30.065 --> 25:31.465
-Go, General Qi! -Wonderful!

420
25:31.545 --> 25:32.705
-Nice blow! -Keep going!

421
25:32.785 --> 25:34.985
-General Qi! -General Qi!

422
25:35.065 --> 25:36.865
-I'll spar with you! -Go, General Qi!

423
25:36.945 --> 25:37.945
That's our General Qi!

424
25:41.985 --> 25:48.185
-Victory! -Victory!

425
25:48.265 --> 25:49.505
General Qi will win!

426
25:49.585 --> 25:55.625
-You'll win! -You'll win!

427
25:58.905 --> 26:00.545
General Qi will win!

428
26:00.625 --> 26:04.905
Victory!

429
26:05.865 --> 26:07.505
Great moves, General Qi!

430
26:07.585 --> 26:12.025
-Nice! -Fantastic!

431
26:12.105 --> 26:15.425
Victory!

432
26:15.505 --> 26:16.545
Great moves, General Lu!

433
26:16.625 --> 26:18.225
Victory!

434
26:18.305 --> 26:20.185
What are you staring at? Don't you have drills to do?

435
26:20.785 --> 26:22.225
Move along! Break it up!

436
26:22.305 --> 26:23.945
-Let's go. Come on. -Let's go. Come on.

437
26:24.025 --> 26:25.825
-That was quite a fight! -It was.

438
26:25.905 --> 26:27.425
-They're far better than us. -They are.

439
26:27.505 --> 26:28.665
General Qi was incredible.

440
26:55.745 --> 26:56.625
Qi Zhongkai, what's wrong with you?

441
26:56.705 --> 26:58.225
You smell like her incense.

442
26:58.745 --> 26:59.865
You're clearly showing off.

443
26:59.945 --> 27:01.265
I should've hit you a few more times.

444
27:01.345 --> 27:02.465
I'm not.

445
27:08.905 --> 27:11.625
Perhaps the maids used it to scent my clothes.

446
27:11.705 --> 27:13.225
Who do you think you're fooling?

447
27:17.865 --> 27:19.025
Qi Zhongkai.

448
27:19.705 --> 27:20.745
Zhongkai!

449
27:21.905 --> 27:25.025
How long are you going to stay angry?

450
27:30.505 --> 27:33.065
My Lord, Zhuyu Estate is taking in refugees this morning.

451
27:35.865 --> 27:37.065
Have the horses prepared.

452
27:48.945 --> 27:50.025
ZHUYU ESTATE

453
27:50.105 --> 27:51.305
Keep moving.

454
27:51.385 --> 27:52.785
Give us your name.

455
27:54.105 --> 27:54.785
-All right, go ahead. -Move along. Go ahead.

456
27:54.865 --> 27:55.985
-Move along. -Go ahead.

457
27:57.305 --> 27:58.665
-Move along. Come on. -Line up!

458
27:58.745 --> 27:59.745
Step up here. Line up!

459
28:03.145 --> 28:05.345
Once you've registered, move ahead. There's food up front.

460
28:07.025 --> 28:07.865
Off you go.

461
28:12.305 --> 28:14.785
-Don't rush. One at a time. -There's enough for everyone.

462
28:14.865 --> 28:15.865
Here you are.

463
28:15.945 --> 28:17.385
Keep moving at the back.

464
28:19.985 --> 28:21.465
-Lodgings are over there. -All right, next.

465
28:21.545 --> 28:23.425
-Thank you. -Thank you.

466
28:23.505 --> 28:24.665
-Keep moving. -Here.

467
28:24.745 --> 28:26.625
-Here you are. -Thank you!

468
28:26.705 --> 28:28.185
-Thank you. -Be careful. It's hot.

469
28:28.785 --> 28:29.945
Here you are.

470
28:30.545 --> 28:31.585
-There's enough for everyone. -Here.

471
28:31.665 --> 28:32.825
Keep moving at the back.

472
28:32.905 --> 28:33.745
Here.

473
28:34.265 --> 28:35.305
-Give me some. -Here's yours.

474
28:35.385 --> 28:36.345
Is the child ill?

475
28:36.905 --> 28:40.265
Your Ladyship, my granddaughter is sick.

476
28:40.345 --> 28:41.225
Those at the back!

477
28:41.305 --> 28:43.385
Please bless her.

478
28:43.465 --> 28:45.185
-There's more over here. -Don't believe the rumors.

479
28:45.705 --> 28:46.945
I'm only human.

480
28:47.545 --> 28:49.105
If your child is ill, take her to a physician.

481
28:54.025 --> 28:55.585
Don't touch her!

482
29:08.025 --> 29:09.825
A spring epidemic has broken out in Ancheng.

483
29:09.905 --> 29:10.985
Countless people have fallen ill or died in the past half month.

484
29:11.945 --> 29:14.865
Prince Fu ordered the city gates shut. These people fled from Ancheng.

485
29:16.225 --> 29:19.625
That's not true! No!

486
29:21.345 --> 29:22.385
What's wrong?

487
29:22.465 --> 29:23.945
What happened?

488
29:24.025 --> 29:25.145
Wake up!

489
29:31.505 --> 29:32.425
Take them away.

490
29:32.505 --> 29:34.945
Some great savior you are!

491
29:35.025 --> 29:37.145
My granddaughter is dying,

492
29:37.225 --> 29:40.145
yet you heartlessly turn us away!

493
29:40.745 --> 29:43.585
What kind of living saint are you?

494
29:43.665 --> 29:47.865
You're a murderer, a demon who brings death!

495
29:47.945 --> 29:49.385
Look, everyone! She's a murderous demon!

496
29:49.465 --> 29:50.865
There's nothing kind about her!

497
29:50.945 --> 29:53.305
-And people think she's a living saint. -Zhao Song.

498
29:53.385 --> 29:55.865
She makes me sick!

499
29:55.945 --> 29:56.905
She's cruel and vicious.

500
29:56.985 --> 29:59.145
-Don't let her fool you! -You monster!

501
29:59.225 --> 30:01.825
You let infected people in. Are you trying to kill everyone?

502
30:03.425 --> 30:05.065
-Who told you to do this? -Qi Zhongkai,

503
30:05.705 --> 30:06.985
this isn't the place.

504
30:07.665 --> 30:08.825
Take him away.

505
30:11.785 --> 30:13.065
I… I don't know anything!

506
30:13.145 --> 30:14.625
I really don't!

507
30:16.345 --> 30:18.745
The illness comes on quickly and hits hard.

508
30:18.825 --> 30:20.385
Ancheng is so far away.

509
30:20.945 --> 30:22.505
How could they have made it here on foot?

510
30:23.065 --> 30:24.505
Someone clearly brought them in carriages.

511
30:25.545 --> 30:26.545
Detain them.

512
30:26.625 --> 30:28.465
Check everyone again.

513
30:28.545 --> 30:30.905
Look for anyone with a pale or bluish face, trembling hands or feet,

514
30:30.985 --> 30:33.785
fever, or convulsions. Don't miss a single one.

515
30:33.865 --> 30:35.065
Have them leave.

516
30:35.585 --> 30:36.465
Yes.

517
30:36.985 --> 30:38.505
-Murderous demon! -Hurry!

518
30:38.585 --> 30:40.105
-Murderous demon! -Move! Hurry!

519
30:40.185 --> 30:41.625
Out! Get out!

520
30:42.425 --> 30:43.545
-Hurry! -Get out!

521
30:44.065 --> 30:45.185
-Hurry! -Out!

522
30:45.265 --> 30:46.385
Move!

523
30:46.465 --> 30:47.305
Hurry!

524
30:47.385 --> 30:50.585
-Murderous demon! -Get out!

525
30:51.785 --> 30:52.905
Move along!

526
30:52.985 --> 30:53.945
Move!

527
30:55.385 --> 30:56.425
-Hurry! -Move!

528
30:57.025 --> 30:58.905
-Move! -Why aren't you stopping her?

529
30:59.505 --> 31:00.945
You can't stop her.

530
31:01.025 --> 31:01.945
Just stay out of her way.

531
31:04.625 --> 31:05.625
Don't cry.

532
31:06.265 --> 31:07.705
I'll buy you some sweets.

533
31:13.345 --> 31:14.505
Everyone, stay calm.

534
31:14.585 --> 31:17.305
Anyone who's ill must have their symptoms recorded accurately.

535
31:17.825 --> 31:19.545
I'll set up quarters for the sick,

536
31:20.145 --> 31:23.185
provide food and water every day, and send physicians and medicinal herbs.

537
31:24.145 --> 31:27.385
With proper care, everyone will be well again.

538
31:28.825 --> 31:32.385
-Thank you, Your Ladyship! -Thank you, Your Ladyship!

539
31:33.105 --> 31:34.305
Now that you've come here,

540
31:34.945 --> 31:37.305
you're my people and deserve my protection.

541
31:38.305 --> 31:39.905
Take the child to a physician.

542
31:41.265 --> 31:42.345
Thank you.

543
31:43.705 --> 31:45.585
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

544
31:46.225 --> 31:47.785
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

545
31:47.865 --> 31:49.145
Her Ladyship acts by Heaven's will,

546
31:49.225 --> 31:51.665
saving lives and easing the people's suffering.

547
31:51.745 --> 31:53.665
May Heaven protect Her Ladyship,

548
31:53.745 --> 31:56.425
and may her kindness bless the entire realm!

549
31:59.305 --> 32:05.145
May Heaven bless Her Ladyship with good fortune and a long life!

550
32:05.225 --> 32:10.025
May she live long and bless all the people!

551
32:10.105 --> 32:11.105
Everyone, get up!

552
32:13.145 --> 32:15.585
Please stop kneeling! Get up!

553
32:18.785 --> 32:20.345
Aman, go into the city

554
32:20.425 --> 32:22.345
and bring every physician skilled in treating epidemics.

555
32:22.425 --> 32:23.465
Hurry.

556
32:23.545 --> 32:24.425
Yes.

557
32:26.025 --> 32:28.145
-Line up! -Form a line!

558
32:28.225 --> 32:29.665
-Get in line! -Hurry!

559
32:29.745 --> 32:31.625
-Line up! -One at a time!

560
32:32.145 --> 32:33.265
Unbelievable.

561
32:33.865 --> 32:36.145
People keep exploiting her kindness to cause trouble,

562
32:36.225 --> 32:37.985
only to help her rise even higher.

563
32:38.065 --> 32:39.065
What's so surprising?

564
32:39.665 --> 32:43.465
I imagine whoever's behind this must be furious right now.

565
32:43.545 --> 32:46.305
I don't know whether they're furious.

566
32:46.385 --> 32:50.105
All I know is you two scared me half to death.

567
33:04.665 --> 33:07.785
Turning everything to her advantage.

568
33:09.025 --> 33:10.985
that is who she truly is.

569
33:25.305 --> 33:26.145
Stop.

570
33:26.225 --> 33:28.065
You'd better tell the truth

571
33:28.585 --> 33:29.985
and spare yourself more pain.

572
33:30.065 --> 33:33.225
I was only trying to help by letting them into the estate.

573
33:33.305 --> 33:36.025
How was I to know which people had the plague?

574
33:36.105 --> 33:38.345
I really don't know anything.

575
33:38.425 --> 33:40.505
I'm innocent!

576
33:41.385 --> 33:42.625
Stubborn, aren't you?

577
33:44.505 --> 33:47.265
You won't talk unless we torture you.

578
33:47.345 --> 33:48.305
Qi Zhongkai!

579
33:55.065 --> 33:56.985
Don't bother. Take him out.

580
33:58.305 --> 34:00.185
Lu Zhuo, you're letting him go?

581
34:09.025 --> 34:12.505
Thank you, Lord Lu, for giving me justice.

582
34:12.585 --> 34:14.545
I'll never forget your kindness.

583
34:14.625 --> 34:15.865
Lu Zhuo!

584
34:15.945 --> 34:18.784
Since we can't get anything out of him, why waste time?

585
34:20.465 --> 34:22.264
Let the people decide his fate.

586
34:23.545 --> 34:26.145
Whether he's torn apart by chariots or stoned to death

587
34:26.225 --> 34:27.665
will depend on his luck.

588
34:27.744 --> 34:29.344
-Lord… Lord Lu! -Take him away.

589
34:29.425 --> 34:31.784
Lord Lu!

590
34:31.865 --> 34:33.585
I really don't know anything!

591
34:33.665 --> 34:35.304
Lord Lu, I'll talk!

592
34:39.744 --> 34:41.185
Lord Lu, I'll talk.

593
34:41.264 --> 34:44.665
Someone gave me two gold pellets and told me

594
34:45.425 --> 34:46.905
to let them in.

595
34:47.784 --> 34:49.985
But I didn't recognize him.

596
34:50.065 --> 34:52.304
I'd never seen him before.

597
34:52.385 --> 34:53.945
I've told you everything I know.

598
34:54.025 --> 34:55.985
Spare me, Lord Lu! Spare me!

599
34:56.065 --> 34:58.065
Give him 50 strokes of the rod and hold him for now.

600
34:58.665 --> 35:00.785
Lord Lu, I told you everything. Please!

601
35:00.865 --> 35:02.985
Lord Lu!

602
35:03.065 --> 35:04.385
I should've known.

603
35:04.905 --> 35:08.425
Who but that petty Crown Prince, who's unworthy of his position,

604
35:08.505 --> 35:11.065
would do something so vile?

605
35:12.705 --> 35:15.345
General Qi, you're no longer angry with me?

606
35:17.865 --> 35:19.265
I can do the math too.

607
35:19.785 --> 35:22.025
Falling out with you would cost me two friends.

608
35:22.625 --> 35:24.065
I won't make such a bad bargain.

609
35:24.905 --> 35:28.305
I've sworn to find someone better than Wei Rao.

610
35:28.985 --> 35:34.385
My wife must surpass her in both wit and virtue.

611
35:35.065 --> 35:39.505
Otherwise, I'd rather never marry than settle for any less.

612
35:41.265 --> 35:42.425
I'm leaving.

613
35:53.505 --> 35:57.505
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

614
36:22.985 --> 36:25.585
Don't worry, Rao. I'll treat Hongxian well.

615
36:25.665 --> 36:27.985
In three days, I'll bring her back to see you.

616
36:53.945 --> 36:55.305
When a girl marries,

617
36:56.225 --> 36:57.785
her brother helps her into the carriage.

618
36:58.385 --> 36:59.905
Your own brother is good for nothing,

619
36:59.985 --> 37:01.705
I sent him to the army to be tempered.

620
37:03.105 --> 37:05.425
Today, let Xiao help you instead.

621
37:06.265 --> 37:07.905
It's for good luck.

622
37:10.105 --> 37:10.985
Come here.

623
37:23.825 --> 37:24.745
Go on.

624
39:07.185 --> 39:08.665
Hongxian is of humble birth.

625
39:08.745 --> 39:11.385
She'll have to settle for the rank now.

626
39:12.465 --> 39:14.745
Once she's had a child in a year or two,

627
39:15.425 --> 39:18.105
you can ask His Majesty to grant her a title.

628
39:18.185 --> 39:20.425
Then she'll have a bright future ahead of her.

629
39:22.345 --> 39:24.545
Don't worry. Let's go inside.

630
39:35.345 --> 39:37.745
My Lord, why don't you go over?

631
39:38.625 --> 39:40.825
It's all right. Let's go.

632
40:23.505 --> 40:25.145
It's beautiful.

633
40:33.985 --> 40:37.025
You've kept forcing my hand.

634
40:37.105 --> 40:38.545
Don't blame me for what comes next.

635
40:40.225 --> 40:41.985
But I mustn't act rashly.

636
40:43.105 --> 40:44.185
Wei Rao,

637
40:44.985 --> 40:46.665
stay calm

638
40:54.225 --> 40:55.385
Did I wake you?

639
40:58.785 --> 41:00.825
-I wanted to say… -I know.

640
41:04.465 --> 41:05.785
You know what I want to say?

641
41:07.385 --> 41:10.505
You want to say, with sick refugees entering the capital,

642
41:11.265 --> 41:13.145
Grandfather and Grandmother getting on in years,

643
41:13.225 --> 41:16.585
you plan to move to the estate as a precaution.

644
41:19.945 --> 41:20.785
And you agree?

645
41:23.145 --> 41:24.465
I'll move there with you.

646
41:25.345 --> 41:26.945
We'll tell the elders together tomorrow.

647
41:31.305 --> 41:32.545
What I meant was…

648
41:32.625 --> 41:34.105
I joined the army at thirteen

649
41:35.145 --> 41:36.785
and crossed countless dangerous lands.

650
41:36.865 --> 41:39.505
I've seen plenty of deadly fevers and plagues.

651
41:40.025 --> 41:41.625
I have more experience handling them.

652
41:42.585 --> 41:43.705
That's one reason.

653
41:43.785 --> 41:45.625
An epidemic spreads rapidly.

654
41:45.705 --> 41:46.825
From one person,

655
41:46.905 --> 41:49.105
it can spread to a household, a village, then a whole town

656
41:49.785 --> 41:51.145
in just two months.

657
41:52.305 --> 41:54.065
Whoever let infected people into the capital

658
41:55.185 --> 41:56.305
isn't merely targeting you.

659
41:58.625 --> 42:00.745
They may have some other scheme in mind.

660
42:01.625 --> 42:02.665
I must stay vigilant.

661
42:03.385 --> 42:05.145
Someone wants to throw the capital into chaos?

662
42:05.225 --> 42:06.105
What's more…

663
42:11.265 --> 42:12.505
Let's sleep.

664
42:12.585 --> 42:14.585
You haven't told me your third reason.

665
42:21.225 --> 42:22.225
I can't bear to be apart from you.

666
42:28.825 --> 42:30.265
Lu Zhuo, I want to…

667
42:30.345 --> 42:31.625
Whatever you're planning,

668
42:32.745 --> 42:33.625
don't tell me.

669
42:36.065 --> 42:38.145
I serve the Emperor and owe him my loyalty.

670
42:38.665 --> 42:41.225
There are some things I'm better off not knowing.

671
42:43.305 --> 42:44.545
Whatever you want to do,

672
42:45.065 --> 42:46.385
go ahead and do it.

673
42:47.185 --> 42:50.145
All my men are yours to command.

674
42:52.465 --> 42:53.505
Really?

675
42:58.825 --> 43:00.465
Then I'm going to do something

676
43:01.905 --> 43:04.025
that will shake the realm.

677
45:16.225 --> 45:18.945
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
